# Scripts run through their shebang must keep LF line endings in every
# checkout: with CRLF the kernel looks for an interpreter named "bash\r" or
# "python3\r" and the script does not start. core.autocrlf=true checkouts
# would otherwise convert them.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Executed by path by the integration tests.
tests/fixtures/claude_shim/claude text eol=lf
